        "text": "MiWay shifted its remaining Islington services to the new regional terminal at Kipling.",
        "source": "https://transittoronto.ca/subway/stations/002-bloor-danforth-subway/kipling.shtml"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Islington",
    "lines": [
      2
    ],
    "source": "https://www.ttc.ca/subway-stations/islington-station",
    "events": [
      {
        "date": "1968-05-11",
        "text": "Islington became the western terminus when the subway extended beyond Keele.",
        "source": "https://transittoronto.ca/subway/5104.shtml"
      },
      {
        "date": "1980-11-22",
        "text": "Kipling took over as the western terminus. Islington became a through station.",
